        "body": "The framework's mechanism list is deliberately plural. Intention, motivation, attention regulation, emotion regulation, extinction, reconsolidation, prosociality, non-attachment, and decentering are presented as interdependent processes strengthened by practice. This is why the review resists reducing mindfulness to attention alone or to a uniform clinical ingredient.",
