        "body": "Although the article is a review, it anchors the framework in concrete empirical reports: brief training effects on symptoms, executive function, and white matter connectivity; physiological signatures of relaxed alertness; and immune or stress-reactivity findings after MBSR or compassion practice. These examples make the framework biologically plausible without settling causal specificity.",
