{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"topics\":[{\"topic_id\":\"topic-mindfulness-as-multidimensional-training\",\"title\":\"Mindfulness as Multidimensional Mental Training\",\"structure_type\":\"wiki\",\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"Component Model\",\"body\":\"S-ART frames mindfulness as training across self-awareness, self-regulation, and self-transcendence rather than as a single capacity. This aligns with the critical claim that mindfulness is an umbrella term whose studies must specify the targeted practices, faculties, interventions, and outcomes.\"},{\"title\":\"Mechanisms\",\"body\":\"A synthesis page should distinguish component mechanisms such as attention regulation, emotion regulation, decentering, non-attachment, prosociality, extinction, and reconsolidation from broad claims about mindfulness as a generic trait or intervention.\"},{\"title\":\"Measurement Implications\",\"body\":\"Measurement should be treated cautiously: self-report questionnaires operationalize different facets, and S-ART-style component models imply that research should track specific biological, cognitive, emotional, behavioral, and social changes over time.\"}],\"claim_ids\":[\"claim-mindfulness-can-be-modeled-as-systematic-mental-training-that-reduces-biased-sel--6f2cabe951a3\",\"claim-s-art-treats-mindfulness-as-a-multidimensional-skillset-rather-than-a-single-uni--019ffda0022f\",\"claim-intention-motivation-attention-regulation-emotion-regulation-extinction-and-reco--002095abdbf2\",\"claim-future-mindfulness-research-needs-longitudinal-measurement-of-s-art-subcomponent--a2496826340c\",\"claim-mindfulness-is-not-a-unitary-construct-it-is-an-umbrella-term-spanning-diverse-p--ab25afeeb846\",\"claim-mindfulness-lacks-a-universally-accepted-technical-definition-so-empirical-findi--b873cbc87071\",\"claim-mindfulness-definition-is-ambiguous--4f220365d6f4\",\"claim-common-mindfulness-questionnaires-operationalize-different-facets-of-mindfulness--19920139d48a\",\"claim-existing-mindfulness-self-report-measures-have-unresolved-construct-validity-lim--65891880856d\",\"claim-research-on-mindfulness-should-shift-from-seeking-one-unitary-mindfulness-measur--210f23dc10a0\"],\"source_ids\":[\"source-05-self-awareness-self-regulation-and-self-transcendence-s-art-a-framework-for-unde-w2005022581--615ee4e1923f\",\"source-04-mind-the-hype-a-critical-evaluation-and-prescriptive-agenda-for-research-on-mind-w2761197918--79c0d54db997\"]},{\"topic_id\":\"topic-attention-regulation-and-sensory-selection\",\"title\":\"Attention Regulation and Sensory Selection\",\"structure_type\":\"wiki\",\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"Shared Attention Concept\",\"body\":\"Mindfulness sources connect practice with attention regulation and altered Attention Network Test subsystems, while alpha-oscillation evidence provides a mechanistic account of selective attention as active suppression of irrelevant sensory processing.\"},{\"title\":\"Training-Specific Effects\",\"body\":\"The behavioral evidence is differentiated rather than global: MBSR is linked to orienting changes, intensive retreat practice to alerting-related detection, and prior concentrative experience to baseline conflict-monitoring differences.\"},{\"title\":\"Sensory Suppression\",\"body\":\"The alpha-band literature supports a complementary concept: attention can bias processing by increasing alpha power in regions that would otherwise process distracters, across visual, auditory, tactile, spatial, feature-based, and intersensory tasks.\"}],\"claim_ids\":[\"claim-intention-motivation-attention-regulation-emotion-regulation-extinction-and-reco--002095abdbf2\",\"claim-mindfulness-based-meditation-is-proposed-to-modulate-self-specifying-and-narrati--0ff3acc89706\",\"claim-short-mindfulness-interventions-have-been-reported-to-improve-clinical-symptoms--38a77abb1074\",\"claim-mindfulness-training-can-improve-attention-related-behavior-by-changing-specific--f9e8e6ee54d7\",\"claim-the-at